            <ArticleTitle>[Studies on warming the middle-jiao and analgesic effect of flos Caryophylli].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>429-32, 448 proceeding</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The effects of water extract and ether extract of Flos Caryophylli have been investigated by four experimental gastric ulcer models, choleresis in rats, two diarrhea models in mice, two pain stimulations in mice, and acute liver injury induced by CCl4 in rats. The results suggest that the action of Flos Caryophylli on dispelling the cold by warming the middle-jiao and curing abdominalgia is related to its anti-ulcer, choleresis increasing, anti-diarrhea and analgesic functions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
